# U.S.S. Enterprise-D's trigger is for the first time each turn charge counters are put on it: Stationing with Llanowar
# Elves puts one on it and exiles the top card, Grizzly Bears, which its controller then casts from exile; Stationing again
# with Gigantosaurus the same turn puts ten more on it and exiles nothing, so the next Grizzly Bears stays on top of the
# library (CR 122.6, 603.2, 721.2a, 601.3).

